WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.626
If you push something, it pushes you back just as hard.

2
00:00:04.327 --> 00:00:09.152
A skater pushes on a wall. The wall pushes back on her, just as hard.

3
00:00:13.896 --> 00:00:18.146
The wall's push moves her away. Once she lets go, she glides.

4
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:22.547
Her push acts on the wall; the wall's push acts on her.
